{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_2FF9F477","title":"Get Recipe from Nola Berg","entry":"Dlg_2FF9F477::entry","exit":"Dlg_2FF9F477::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_6AE419BF","articyId":"72057714297016594","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nola Berg","text":"Hello there, haven't seen you before.","speakerId":"Ntt_4AEB60D1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hello there, haven't seen you before.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":350.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24406","byteOffset":17110792,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_47124A5B","articyId":"72057714297016608","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nola Berg","text":"You mean Thaddeus is gone? Ha! That's the best news I've had all day.","speakerId":"Ntt_4AEB60D1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You mean Thaddeus is gone? Ha! That's the best news I've had all day.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":961.7999877929688,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38845","byteOffset":29027376,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_7077E7DD","articyId":"72057714297016629","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nola Berg","text":"He always acted like he was so much better than the rest of us. Even though that crummy bar of his never made a Lim.","speakerId":"Ntt_4AEB60D1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He always acted like he was so much better than the rest of us. Even though that crummy bar of his never made a Lim.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1563.199951171875,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46614","byteOffset":31967256,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_CC277EFA","articyId":"72057714297016641","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nola Berg","text":"I can tell you're a rookie or you wouldn't just ask like that. We're in competition, after all.","speakerId":"Ntt_4AEB60D1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I can tell you're a rookie or you wouldn't just ask like that. We're in competition, after all.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2150.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36396","byteOffset":28114120,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_84E3C0B7","articyId":"72057714297016662","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nola Berg","text":"Bit of banter never goes amiss. Warm people up first.","speakerId":"Ntt_4AEB60D1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Bit of banter never goes amiss. Warm people up first.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2723.60009765625,"y":50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49554","byteOffset":33088432,"byteLength":400}},{"id":"DFr_CA4D895A","articyId":"72057714297016669","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nola Berg","text":"You're like a dog with a bone aren't you? Normally I'd say no, but since you're new, I'll do you a favor this once.","speakerId":"Ntt_4AEB60D1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You're like a dog with a bone aren't you? Normally I'd say no, but since you're new, I'll do you a favor this once.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2725.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52204","byteOffset":34163696,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_C63B431D","articyId":"72057714297016702","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nola Berg","text":"Alright alright, no need to be a kiss-ass. Normally I'd say no, but since you're new, I'll do you a favor this once.","speakerId":"Ntt_4AEB60D1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Alright alright, no need to be a kiss-ass. Normally I'd say no, but since you're new, I'll do you a favor this once.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3725.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27683","byteOffset":18354312,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_5E4FC158","articyId":"72057714297016720","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nola Berg","text":"I'd hardly call it help, but yeah, sure. Don't think you'll be putting me out of business anytime soon.","speakerId":"Ntt_4AEB60D1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'd hardly call it help, but yeah, sure. Don't think you'll be putting me out of business anytime soon.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4298.60009765625,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44240","byteOffset":31070536,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_AC4B0CAD","articyId":"72057714297016741","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nola Berg","text":"Ha! I like your grit. You'll do ok.","speakerId":"Ntt_4AEB60D1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ha! I like your grit. You'll do ok.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":5163.2001953125,"y":-125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27126","byteOffset":18141344,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_E500CF79","articyId":"72057714297016758","type":"lin